# harness.pdl - the rmmc book's own tools (2026-11-26). The TUTORIAL rows start and stop the in-game lesson (tutorial.pdl; ops/rmmc_tutorial_op.c). Picking "Tutorial" only stores where the lesson starts in the ledger (play/tutorial.txt, a
# preference); the lesson itself is read from the ledger, so Stop never changes the game. The start row names the ledger FOLDER: the lesson remembers where it started in every page ledger there (ledger.txt, ledger_alpha.txt), so it works on whichever page is open.
# HARNESS | id | page | kind | label | target | args | writes | confirm | note      (grammar: the header of &.widgits/_shared-lib/ops/harness_menu_op.c)
HARNESS | tut_lesson1 | * | ACTION | Lesson 1: drive Asa | @.apps/rmmc/ops/+x/rmmc_tutorial_op.+x | start ${APP} ${HOUSE}/@.apps/rpg-edit-hq/state/games/rmmc/game lesson1 | - | no | starts lesson 1: the left bar shows each step; Tutorial: stop ends it
HARNESS | tut_stop | * | ACTION | Stop the lesson | @.apps/rmmc/ops/+x/rmmc_tutorial_op.+x | stop ${APP} | - | no | ends the lesson (deletes play/tutorial.txt); the game is untouched
HARNESS | tut_check | * | CASE | Check the lessons | rmmc_tutorial | - | - | no | the tutorial op: progress read from the ledger in order, controls that must not advance
HARNESS | tut_stranger | * | CASE | Check lesson 1 as a stranger | rmmc_stranger | - | - | no | plays lesson 1 from the screen words only: each step the screen says, the key it names, through the real driver (D146)
HARNESS | aim_check | * | CASE | Check aiming (dig what you aim at) | rmmc_aim | - | - | no | the crosshair file decides which block B digs and where G places; reach stays the game rule (D147)
HARNESS | guns_check | * | CASE | Check the guns (.22, auto, bazooka) | rmmc_guns | - | - | no | the shoot verb of vox_op: range, walls, hardness, bedrock, the bazooka crater, ammo, replay, forged rows (D158)
HARNESS | fire_check | * | CASE | Check fire and water (flamethrower, water gun) | rmmc_fire | - | - | no | fire spreads and burns out, the water gun puts it out, water falls and dries, per-turn caps (D159)
HARNESS | creative_toggle | * | ACTION | Game: creative mode on/off (default off) | @.apps/rmmc/ops/+x/rmmc_mode_op.+x | toggle ${APP} | - | no | flips play/creative.txt; ON = the hotbar gives the picked tool and block before every swing and place (nothing runs out); OFF = a mine adds the drop, a place costs one
HARNESS | help_1 | * | ACTION | Arrows: walk | @.apps/rmmc/ops/+x/rmmc_mode_op.+x | status ${APP} | - | no | Help row: reads only, changes nothing (the keys come from rmmc-pchq/pieces/system/keybinds.pdl)
HARNESS | help_2 | * | ACTION | Space: jump | @.apps/rmmc/ops/+x/rmmc_mode_op.+x | status ${APP} | - | no | Help row: reads only, changes nothing (the keys come from rmmc-pchq/pieces/system/keybinds.pdl)
HARNESS | help_3 | * | ACTION | B: mine block | @.apps/rmmc/ops/+x/rmmc_mode_op.+x | status ${APP} | - | no | Help row: reads only, changes nothing (the keys come from rmmc-pchq/pieces/system/keybinds.pdl)
HARNESS | help_4 | * | ACTION | G: place block | @.apps/rmmc/ops/+x/rmmc_mode_op.+x | status ${APP} | - | no | Help row: reads only, changes nothing (the keys come from rmmc-pchq/pieces/system/keybinds.pdl)
HARNESS | help_5 | * | ACTION | M: craft item | @.apps/rmmc/ops/+x/rmmc_mode_op.+x | status ${APP} | - | no | Help row: reads only, changes nothing (the keys come from rmmc-pchq/pieces/system/keybinds.pdl)
HARNESS | help_6 | * | ACTION | 1-9: pick a slot | @.apps/rmmc/ops/+x/rmmc_mode_op.+x | status ${APP} | - | no | Help row: reads only, changes nothing (the keys come from rmmc-pchq/pieces/system/keybinds.pdl)
