HARNESS | help_8 | * | ACTION | Y U I O P: camera | @.apps/rmmc/ops/+x/rmmc_mode_op.+x | status ${APP} | - | no | Help row: reads only, changes nothing (the keys come from rmmc-pchq/pieces/system/keybinds.pdl)
